        satisfies    [@plan.Hosts.O3]

        description
            Source Bead: flow-state-e7p.5.1 (open).
            Proof IDs: PROOF-008, PROOF-012, PROOF-013, HOST-P02, HOST-P03, HOST-P04, HOST-P05.
            Deliverable: React attaches to an existing Runtime and reads through passive selectors.
            Include FlowProvider, actor hooks, SSR, and request host isolation.
            Allowed writes: packages/flow-state-rewrite/src/hosts/**.
            Public routes and package facades belong to Phase 6 entrypoint ownership.
            Evidence: Co-located owner tests, package typecheck, and lint; return paths and results.
            Absorbs host attachment and SSR proof lanes from closed Bead flow-state-e7p.5.7.
            Keep each decisive proof at its production owner.
            Phase 4 validation T405 must pass before this work starts.
        acceptance
            Render and abandoned preparation acquire no host or actor ownership.
            Commit rechecks the provider and attaches the same prepared actor.
            At least 64 prepared commands work; overflow rejects without partial mutation.
            Strict Mode and Activity preserve identity; suspension releases work without replay.
            Selectors are passive, track exact dependencies, and memoize defects correctly.
            SSR and request hosts isolate Runtime state.
            Actor and selector types preserve exact machine families, lifecycle, and selected data.
            Positive and negative React type fixtures reject acquisition and mutation through reads.
            Run `nubx vp test packages/flow-state-rewrite/src/hosts/tests`,
            `nub run --filter flow-state-rewrite check:types`, `nub run test`, and
            `nub run lint`. Expected: all checks pass.
    T501
        title        Story recipes and production materialization
        status       draft
        priority     high
        blocked_by   [@task.Rewrite.T405]
        derives_from [
                     @plan.Runtime.D1,
                     @plan.Runtime.D2,
                     @plan.Runtime.V6,
