        description
            Source Bead: flow-state-e7p.5.2 (open).
            Proof IDs: PROOF-001, PROOF-008, PROOF-011 prerequisite, PROOF-012, TYPE-P01,
            TYPE-P02, REV-TEST-002.
            Deliverable: Inert Story builders, immutable recipes, exact fixtures, and per-run
            production Runtime materialization with provider-first setup and reverse cleanup.
            Each run uses a fresh Runtime; shared prefixes create independent derived plans.
            Allowed writes: packages/flow-state-rewrite/src/stories/**.
            Public routes and package facades belong to Phase 6 entrypoint ownership.
            Evidence: Story owner behavior tests, type proofs, package typecheck, and lint receipts.
            Absorbs Story construction and materialization proof lanes from closed
            Bead flow-state-e7p.5.7.
            Phase 4 validation T405 must pass before this work starts.
        acceptance
            Construction acquires no service, Runtime, or actor.
            REV-TEST-002: Builder calls are inert and only run() executes. Through the production
            runner, prove receiver mutation and late configuration mutation cannot change the
            captured AppPlan, RuntimeSetup, Implementation, Persistence, Clock, fixtures, seeds,
            or runner options.
            Each run uses production owners and a fresh Runtime; providers materialize first.
            Reused recipes materialize once per run; separate runs share no live state or handles.
            App Stories use exact refs and recipes without context injection.
            Positive and negative type fixtures preserve exact input, context, and fixture closure.
            Options are closed, invalid targets reject, and maxTurns defaults to 100.
            Run `nubx vp test packages/flow-state-rewrite/src/stories/tests`,
            `nub run --filter flow-state-rewrite check:types`, `nub run test`, and
            `nub run lint`. Expected: all checks pass.
    T502
        title        Story commands and truthful run evidence
        status       draft
        priority     high
        blocked_by   [@T501, @task.Rewrite.T405]

        derives_from [
                     @plan.Runtime.D1,
